---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Switch players from the Autodarts page
    accDescr: In fullscreen or kiosk mode, a tap on the round button in a corner of the Autodarts page, or the keyboard shortcut, opens the switcher over the page. It is a page of the extension in a frame, so the page can't read the accounts. A tap on a player, or the keys 1 to 9, switches; on a match page the switcher asks first, before any token is spent, and the page reloads as the chosen player.

    button["A tap on the button in a corner<br>or the keyboard shortcut"]
    switcher["The switcher over the page<br>a page of the extension in a frame:<br>the page can't read the accounts"]
    pick["A tap on a player<br>or the keys 1 to 9"]
    match{"Does a match run<br>in the page?"}
    ask["Ask: switching ends the match<br>on this display"]
    keep["Keep playing<br>nothing changes"]
    switch["Switch: park the session,<br>write the chosen one, reload"]

    button --> switcher --> pick --> match
    match -- "no" --> switch
    match -- "yes" --> ask
    ask -- "Switch anyway" --> switch
    ask -- "Keep playing" --> keep

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class switcher bot
    class ask person
    class switch done
